  "notes": [
    "-AR verb with accent change in presente: í is stressed in all forms except *nosotros* (*envío, envías, envía, envían*).",
    "The accent on í prevents the *i* from merging into a diphthong with the following vowel.",
    "Nosotros present (*enviamos*) and all other tenses follow regular -AR endings with no accent change.",
    "*Envié un correo electrónico esta mañana.* (I sent an email this morning.)",
    "*¿Me envías la dirección?* (Can you send me the address?)",
    "Related: *el envío* (sending, shipment), *el/la enviado/a* (envoy, correspondent)"
  ],
